tory":[{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Beer, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants, Wine & Spirits","shared_category_count":7},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (New), American (Traditional), Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":6},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"OI2J5UsaCSD1xFnY0psJ2w","review_id":"f_N5b1TIm6fcq1GQR5p4Uw","date":"2012-01-25T07:25:06","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9341033697128296,"text_excerpt":"I love this place. I met the owner in Indy and wanted to stop by his bar when I came down to NOLA. Its every bit as awesome as I had hoped it would be. Its classy, upscale, sophisticated.....anyone who steps into Victory will immediately appreciate a place like this. The drinks take a few minutes to make, but the bartenders put a ton of effort and pride into them....freshly squeezing the ingredients and shaking the cocktail to perfection. I had a gin fizz as well as what Mr. Victory calls a rum mint julep, which was similar to a mojito. I also had a hurricane, which was very good considering the large amount of rum in it. No grenadine or that artificial sugar crap. Prices aren't bad for a..."},{"business_id":"OI2J5UsaCSD1xFnY0psJ2w","review_id":"dj1RJ-Mtoo8Tlm8WDE80sg","date":"2012-03-31T06:45:25","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9339696168899536,"text_excerpt":"This is a great place to meet for drinks. They have an extensive drink menu with several unique and local options. I love that they let you try a sample of the daily cocktail for free. This days was tasty, so we both purchased one. I wish I listened to what it was. We tried the chicken satay appetizer. It was tasty. The peanut dipping sauce was very good. The staff was friendly and helpfull."},{"business_id":"OI2J5UsaCSD1xFnY0psJ2w","review_id":"1WugxN9O1KIq8RF6J10iow","date":"2016-01-19T02:44:44","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9332716464996338,"text_excerpt":"I always enjoy this place. They have great craft cocktails. The free sample of the drink of the day is a nice tough. It is a really good place to chill with friends or with a significant other. It can get a little crowded at times though. The food, although a very limited menu, is really good as well."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"OI2J5UsaCSD1xFnY0psJ2w","photo_id":"BPGvpavUQJsyrz2MjxuTpQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/BPGvpavUQJsyrz2MjxuTpQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9405583143234253},{"business_id":"OI2J5UsaCSD1xFnY0psJ2w","photo_id":"x4Uiwq1E5r8181hE9wNMZQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/x4Uiwq1E5r8181hE9wNMZQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.918408215045929},{"business_id":"OI2J5UsaCSD1xFnY0psJ2w","photo_id":"dohYaIl4N1abkMWLozPPbA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/dohYaIl4N1abkMWLozPPbA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.91762048006